WEBVTT

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.900
Wow, that's so cute.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.160
A homestay?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.520
That's amazing.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.870
Is that the thing where you stay in a foreigner's house?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.830
Where are you going?

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.880
England!

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:16.620
I'm going to be staying with my mother's friends for about a week.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.630
But, Shino, you can't speak English.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:21.860
How rude.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.380
I can speak a little.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.800
Like, "hello".

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.760
What else?

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:27.220
"Guts pose!"

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.680
That's a Japanese word!

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:33.640
I'll pray every day for your safe return.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.140
Thank you.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.690
Apparently, there's a girl about my age in the family.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:40.520
Really?

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.110
It'd be nice if you became friends.

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:42.650
I know.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.370
<i>I wonder what she's like.</i>

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.040
Daddy's home.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.210
Thank you.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.220
Shinobu.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.720
Coming.

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.100
Welcome, Shinobu.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:05.810
Nice to meet you.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.190
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.030
Hello.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.040
H-Hello.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.530
<i>What beautiful blonde hair!</i>

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.090
I look forward to staying with you.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:33.880
Um...

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.650
She's a shy girl.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:47.690
Oh, it's okay.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.430
You can come right in.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:54.990
Oh, right.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.160
It's so foreign.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.460
This is the living room.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:05.960
...the bathroom.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.840
If you have any laundry, let me know.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.940
Okay.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.670
We eat dinner at seven.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.670
This is your room.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.010
Make yourself at home.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:19.720
I will.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.660
Do you have any questions?

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:25.730
Where is your daughter?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.110
She looks like this doll...

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:31.120
Hello.
She looks like this doll...

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.360
Hello.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.040
Oh, um...

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.990
Poppy, go back to your house.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:44.080
Alice, she wants to be your friend.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.090
Shinobu.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.420
I'm Oomiya Shinobu.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.480
Omi...

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.040
You can call me Shinobu.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.390
My name is Alice Cartelet.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.160
She's blonde!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.300
She's a blonde girl!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.180
Wait!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.310
Alice!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.060
Already getting along very well.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:14.820
Japanese girls are so scary!

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.160
I hope you like it.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.080
Thanks for the food.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.040
Shinobu, how is it?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.100
It's delicious.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.860
Aren't you going to eat that dessert?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:36.970
Nope.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:49.890
<i>Oh!</i>

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.480
<i>Are you expecting any Japanese girls?</i>

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.650
<i>Sounds fun!</i>

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.900
<i>But I don't speak much Japanese.</i>

00:05:58.480 --> 00:05:59.780
<i>I got an idea!</i>

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:01.990
<i>While the Japanese girl is at the homestay,</i>

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.880
<i>why don't you be my little sister and stay with me? </i>

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.630
<i>No, I am the big sister!</i>

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.250
<i>Then I am going for my trip tomorrow.</i>

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.340
<i>Karen's family seem to love travelling so much.</i>

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.050
<i>Ta-da!</i>

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:22.340
<i>Here, I will give you a funny doll to protect you.</i>

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.540
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.570
<i>Maybe we don't speak the same language, but we can...</i>

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.060
<i>...communicate as long as we try to listen to each other's heart!</i>

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.400
That's a big assumption...

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:07.040
Hey, Poppy!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:07.780
Come here!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:08.600
Come on!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.360
Hey!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.480
Good boy, Poppy!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.400
You're so clever, Poppy!

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:19.030
Alice, good morning.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:21.670
Poppy!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.120
Are you hurt?

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.790
No, I'm fine.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.830
Did she apologise?

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.190
It wasn't Alice's fault.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.570
I'll go heat up some milk.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.130
Thank you.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:50.140
Uh, well...

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.770
Alice.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.570
Hello.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.480
Thank you for this.

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:13.160
It's very warm.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.310
Thank you...

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:16.170
Thank you?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.290
Yes, thank you.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.040
Aren't you mad at me?

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.090
Yes, it's very warm.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.220
I'd like to thank you.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:27.780
Could you come with me?

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:28.680
Chocolate?

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:29.950
This way.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:32.850
Here.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:35.400
It's a gift from Japan.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.600
I actually meant to give it to you yesterday.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.610
My older sister picked it out.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.160
She said foreigners would like it.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.570
Let me see it.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.750
You do this, and...

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:57.670
There.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.340
Oh, you're supposed to put it in your hair.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.380
Thank you, Onee-chan.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.380
Alice, I understand now.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.610
You're supposed to put it in your hair and turn it.

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.440
Turn.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:23.360
Turn.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.200
I'm sorry I couldn't help.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.450
Shinobu.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:36.830
Thank you.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:43.380
You can use them as chopsticks.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.880
Shinobu, are you good at baking?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.450
Mix it well.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.640
Okay.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.410
Hello.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.850
Thank you.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.210
Come here.

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:59.410
I'll take you to the airport tomorrow.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:00.750
Thank you.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.040
Let's play Hanafuda.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.700
Oh, Hanafuda.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.760
But I don't know the rules.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:13.470
Hyakunin isshu or Fukuwarai?

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.580
Wow!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.300
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.560
She wants to know if you're really Japanese.

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:26.060
I'm pure Japanese!

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:36.030
Alice, how is the bath?

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:40.700
It's a cherry blossom scented bath mix.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:44.080
People over here don't fill their baths very deep, right?

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:46.250
Soak all the way up to your shoulders.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.330
This smells like Japan.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:08.360
Shinobu, I feel dizzy.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.360
Alice!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.100
Good night.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.340
Hello.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.680
Can I sleep next to you?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.680
Hello.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.940
What is Japan like?

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:50.760
Japan?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:53.190
It's morning in Japan right now.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.760
It's strange, isn't it?

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:59.320
It's still night here, but the sun is already rising.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:04.330
It feels like we've been placed on the edge of the world all by ourselves.

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:08.860
I bet Aya-chan would enjoy talking about this.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:15.090
I hope I go visit Japan someday.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.980
Thank you for letting me stay in your home.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.650
Come visit us again.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:31.310
I will.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.330
Hello.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.620
Thank you.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.620
I'll send you pictures.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.220
Hello!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:03.600
He-

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:08.230
Hello!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:11.190
Hello, hello!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:16.780
Hello!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.080
Japan.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.760
Shinobu, wake up.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:55.310
You're going to be late.

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.550
Okay.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:09.500
Shinobu.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.750
Shinobu, school!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.750
See you later.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.640
Good morning, Shinobu-chan.

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:32.390
Good morning.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:37.900
G-Good morning.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.730
So, anyway...

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:42.360
Good morning.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.570
You're finally here.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:44.700
Shino, you're late.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:47.490
Sorry, I was reading a letter.

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.230
A letter?

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.740
Whoa, it's air mail.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:53.000
Is it from the family you stayed with in England?

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.870
Yes, it's from Alice.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.580
That's amazing.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.170
All the way from Wonderland, huh?

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.250
You mean England.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:03.380
But it's all written in English, and I can't read it.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.470
I thought you said you were reading it.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:06.800
Let me see.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.760
It really is in English!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:09.850
"Dear Shinobu..."

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:12.310
I'm Oomiya Shinobu.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.890
Come on, we're high school students now.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.060
Do that later, you two!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.770
Good morning.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:23.280
This is the first letter you've received?

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.010
Yeah.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.570
I wonder what it says.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.640
Oh, fine.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:28.820
Let me see that.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:32.830
I think it says she's coming to Japan.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.330
<i>Probably.</i>

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.370
Amazing!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.370
Aya-chan, you can read English?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.810
Does it say when she's coming?

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.630
You'd better not let Shino down.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.460
S-Shut up, Youko!

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:50.930
Your school... so happy... uniform...

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.600
Happy uniform?

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.980
Hey, Shino, your shoes.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.590
Sorry, hold on.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.610
You there, excuse me.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:13.830
A blonde girl!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.790
Do you know a girl named Shinobu?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.360
What? Shino?

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:22.590
I'm sorry I don't have a recent photo...

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.130
But she looks just like this doll.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.470
Hey, excuse you!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:28.800
Ah, there you are.

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:31.140
Cartelet-san, this way.

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:32.550
Okay.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:34.250
Please excuse me.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:38.230
Castanet?

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.490
What a fun name.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.360
Thanks for waiting.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.450
It's curious.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:51.240
Yeah.

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:54.080
That girl was wearing one of our uniforms.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.750
No, I mean, Shino just looks like a wooden doll to me now.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:58.660
That's what you took from it?!

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.630
Good morning.

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.710
Good morning, Sensei!

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:07.630
Oomiya-san, you're as energetic as ever.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.380
Yes!

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:10.510
Come in.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:15.890
She's so cute.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.100
It's that girl.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.600
Alice?

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.650
Shinobu!

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:29.840
It's good to see you again.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.360
You really did come.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.330
Yeah, I came to see you.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.200
Alice, your Japanese...

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.080
I've been studying.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.330
That's amazing.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.000
But what are you doing here?

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.170
Cartelet-san, please introduce yourself first.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.840
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.010
Nice to meet you.

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:51.340
My name is Alice Cartelet.

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:53.340
I transferred here from England.

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:55.640
What?

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:56.970
Took you long enough to notice!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.930
I wrote about it in my letter.

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.930
It was in English, so...

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.650
I thought you might have trouble, so I wrote the second one in romaji.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.180
What?!

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:06.150
Aya.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:10.070
I look forward to being part of this class.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:45.330
I can't believe a foreigner transferred into our school right after we entered high school.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.500
Her hair and eyes look just like a doll's.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.750
I know what you mean.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:53.050
I wish I could put her in a dress, stick her in a show case,

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.630
and stare at her all day long.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:57.870
Just kidding.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:20:59.330
Huh?

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.470
It was just a joke. Come on, laugh.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.430
I thought you were serious.

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:04.770
Here, I wrote it out for you.

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:06.190
Thank you.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.020
Komichi Aya.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:11.610
Nice to meet you.

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:14.610
Inokuma Youko.

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:16.700
"Boar" and "bear" make "Inokuma"!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:18.410
It's a kind of strong and cool name, right?

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:23.290
I don't taste very good.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.290
Broken Japanese?!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.420
That hairpin is cute.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:33.800
Ah, this?

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:37.160
Shinobu gave it to me when she came to stay with us.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.550
You kept it all this time?

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:43.850
I thought you were supposed to stab people with hairpins.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:44.600
Scary...

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:45.560
Are you a "professional"?

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.520
Where are you going to live while you're in Japan?

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.940
You came by yourself, right?

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:50.600
Yes.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.310
At Shinobu's house...

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.820
Alice!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:57.690
You're all alone with nowhere to go...

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:00.030
You can come stay with me!

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:01.570
We don't have much, though!

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:04.190
What? That's what I intended...

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:06.980
You make a funny pair.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:15.440
My name is Alice.

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:16.670
Thank you for letting me stay here.

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:21.090
My mum kept your visit secret from me.

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:22.590
I'm a little shocked.

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:24.890
I didn't say anything because I was hoping to surprise you.

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:25.850
I'm sorry.

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:28.980
Anyway, your Japanese is very good.

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:30.690
You sit very well, too.

00:22:30.690 --> 00:22:33.400
I've studied Japan a lot.

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:36.360
I even wore a kimono once.

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:38.400
Sitting like this is difficult,

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:41.360
but the kimono was heavy and hot and hard to wear, too.

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:45.080
They say the twelve layers weigh approximately 10 kg.

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:48.370
I believed I could become a virtuous Japanese woman if I endured it...

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:51.210
You don't need to endure it if it's so painful!

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:54.010
Please take it easy.

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:55.460
Make yourself at home.

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:59.210
Oh, I have something for you.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:01.050
My, how thoughtful.

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:04.970
I bought these dorayaki at the airport.

00:23:04.970 --> 00:23:06.310
Made in Japan?!

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:14.150
<i>When the cherry blossoms were blooming,</i>

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:18.320
<i>an English girl came to stay in our home.</i>

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:24.740
Alice, welcome to Japan!

00:23:24.740 --> 00:23:27.090
I have a foreign style room.

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.020
Do you have a Goemon bath in your bathroom?

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:31.040
No.

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:33.540
This is...

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:36.000
See you next time.
